{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一年一度雙十一網購旺季殺到，正是為鞋櫃與秋冬造型大換血的最好時機！Catalog網店現正舉行11.11狂歡慶典，多個大熱運動及休閒品牌如Adidas 、New Balance、ASICS等熱門跑鞋推至震撼低價，男女裝服飾亦低至數十元起跳。網店更設有免運費門檻、滿額立減碼及新會員迎新禮遇，若打算趁平添置新裝的話就不要錯過！即睇以下精選優惠商品！</p><figure><img alt=\"Catalog網店由即日起舉行「11.11狂歡慶典」，逾千款大熱品牌現貨推重大折扣。（Catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197236883860492288125873.png/xDRXkCrx4O7Oq61hltt7PHtN5PpLnXDiUyDC3VMgwt0\"/><figcaption>Catalog網店由即日起舉行「11.11狂歡慶典」，逾千款大熱品牌現貨推重大折扣。（Catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><p>熱門鞋款低至3折起</p><p>Catalog網店今次雙11的鞋款減價幅度相當進取，多款平日甚少大幅降價的人氣款式均榜上有名！當中大熱的Adidas Samba JP球鞋，直接由原價$899狂減至$269，約3折即可入手；女裝Samba與復古感十足的Handball Spezial亦只需$429，Superstar II則降至$359，指定Adidas鞋款更享有買2件8折優惠。</p><figure><img alt=\"Catalog網店今次雙11的鞋款減價幅度相當進取，多款平日甚少大幅降價的人氣款式均榜上有名。（Catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197233703726616576026541.png/8NfEvjES8r__e_bvl0IxVU5udbNmB0iwE2ukShNrpEo\"/><figcaption>Catalog網店今次雙11的鞋款減價幅度相當進取，多款平日甚少大幅降價的人氣款式均榜上有名。（Catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><p>大熱鞋款New Balance 530亦激減至半價$399（原價$799），同場New Balance 740球鞋同樣減至$399。另外ASICS人氣款GT-2160低至$359即可帶走，Gel-1130與Gel-K1011亦分別減至$389及$399；至於帆布鞋亦有Converse Chuck 70 Ox由原價$599降至$179，以及售$289的Vans Premium Authentic休閒鞋。</p><p>服裝與配飾專區同樣精彩，多款百搭男女裝上衣最平低至$39起，褲款與裙裝亦只需$69起。其中原價$699的Adidas Originals球衣T恤現時減至$489（原價$699）即可入手；至於踏入天氣降溫必備的外套也有半價驚喜，原價$599的PUMA Varsity Standard女子連帽外套現時只需$299即可入手，日常配搭也十分划算！</p><figure><img alt=\"Adidas Samba LT球鞋 $399（原價$999）（catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197244316414644224318674.jpeg/8xOPgHr7S_IAXTm8sHiDfzxS-cLy-p8GAvlAOgL5QDo\"/><figcaption>Adidas Samba LT球鞋 $399（原價$999）（catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Adidas Handball Special 球鞋 $269（原價$899）（catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197244318700670976175602.jpeg/8-qyy8NnKPExHhk7m4AYUicpG4v53qXCY8OBP2PDgT8\"/><figcaption>Adidas Handball Special 球鞋 $269（原價$899）（catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"New balance 327 球鞋 $339（原價$849）（Catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197233394291970048936725.jpeg/7KWuHLQ4HkNEyIMUgwjhfwZgOM_-Ws7ifBTMtnwUzLY\"/><figcaption>New balance 327 球鞋 $339（原價$849）（Catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Converse Chuck 70 Ox帆布鞋 $179 （原價$599）（Catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197233395709906944197580.jpeg/BP0UFw0BRTlqe5s68IrjpDFaJ628mFnYd-Lod3fi6Hc\"/><figcaption>Converse Chuck 70 Ox帆布鞋 $179 （原價$599）（Catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hoka Mafate Speed 2越野跑步鞋 $1049（原價$1499）（Catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197233397933019136931452.jpeg/RCu7fmd3xQqHcKYSdh46k_DJ1GxYLt456uB95ergfeU\"/><figcaption>Hoka Mafate Speed 2越野跑步鞋 $1049（原價$1499）（Catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"PUMA Bella Donna Suede 女子休閒鞋 $369（原價$599）（Catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197233391955611648319867.jpeg/zVy6RWBbLEghD_qvL4pEbzKOGoHDvDZ3pLZWl6S2Vpc\"/><figcaption>PUMA Bella Donna Suede 女子休閒鞋 $369（原價$599）（Catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Birkenstock Arizona 涼鞋 $559（原價$800）（Catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197233393490989056736190.jpeg/jMzWEgOiVcUYWuAPnRZcziM6zGD2agv1PdrzNj3a8zY\"/><figcaption>Birkenstock Arizona 涼鞋 $559（原價$800）（Catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Adidas Originals 球衣T恤 $489（原價$699）（Catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197233391171407872513967.jpeg/KSbQgFSmP3zNW_7sVzX6wISxHdCQd6XqGVL96BlS_eg\"/><figcaption>Adidas Originals 球衣T恤 $489（原價$699）（Catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"PUMA Varsity Standard 女子連帽外套 $299（原價$599）（Catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197235718255022080846075.jpeg/9YQQUd_QXBRbnycXqWzaWeJhr6AnVtnUQHN-uUBzfrk\"/><figcaption>PUMA Varsity Standard 女子連帽外套 $299（原價$599）（Catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Adidas 燈籠長款半截裙 $399（原價$699）（catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197239721731035136041975.jpeg/W5CdaJqZuFTj1E-c1-qXKH62HqlvGSdnvhldD74ZXQ8\"/><figcaption>Adidas 燈籠長款半截裙 $399（原價$699）（catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><p>男女服裝低至$39起　人氣IP聯乘系列登場</p><p>聯乘系列向來是Catalog的招牌焦點，今次雙11除經典款式外，更加入不少全新IP單品，包括Opanchu褲褲兔聯乘系列、玉桂狗Cinnamoroll、《海賊王》、《玩轉腦朋友2》等專屬服飾與周邊配件。結帳時若想湊夠免運門檻，更可於夾單專區以$15起加購精選襪款或$19起選購實用小配件。</p><figure><img alt=\"Cinnamon圖案針織開胸外套 $259（原價$659）（catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197239719491145728902347.jpeg/qLb2yb42tJp47bXgagjut7UT4ZOqK-jAGbm_QBm5v0A\"/><figcaption>Cinnamon圖案針織開胸外套 $259（原價$659）（catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"KUROMI車花長襪 $99（原價$199）（catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197239717351919616821740.jpeg/Tyk94_4ZtUrWsksp4F5APSy_ALMAe_9A6CF7s-ghe7M\"/><figcaption>KUROMI車花長襪 $99（原價$199）（catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Catalog精選聯乘IP商品（catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227277000118272692501.jpeg/qjX7E6Ek9ZW1LhMq48XwzALR6DKE4zxgIY9VgCGPVYA\"/><figcaption>Catalog精選聯乘IP商品（catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Catalog精選聯乘IP商品（catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227279139344384059127.jpeg/EOInSSWetqyTJEB_zAWrLoPMqQcL0eFzp3TbV6d021c\"/><figcaption>Catalog精選聯乘IP商品（catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Catalog精選聯乘IP商品（catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227281161129984643280.jpeg/gOW5r2Msg0PD9JyuLjXcGxKt3VvwVW6rjhq_jI4av4w\"/><figcaption>Catalog精選聯乘IP商品（catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Catalog精選聯乘IP商品（catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227282939645952256748.jpeg/JeM4Q-n6YDPdwieMovNFc31l0a-zIspEtLrCYbS6wmE\"/><figcaption>Catalog精選聯乘IP商品（catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Catalog精選聯乘IP商品（catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227284835602432459082.jpeg/1-5bellqYR7ZSVB8f4zDZjMsjC1usZjwIUnG0SFJxtE\"/><figcaption>Catalog精選聯乘IP商品（catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Catalog精選聯乘IP商品（catalog官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227276484218880356091.jpeg/yNKCH_0Qr0ytcFCmZ3OZvdAv__vTyXIVOot7gTqLe4E\"/><figcaption>Catalog精選聯乘IP商品（catalog官網）</figcaption></figure><p>折上折優惠碼滿額即減</p><p>在網店下單全單消費淨額滿$700即可享免費送貨上門。單筆訂單淨值滿$900輸入指定優惠碼即減$50，滿$1,200輸入指定碼更可直接扣減$100。</p><p>新註冊會員可獲贈$100迎新電子優惠券（滿$1,000可用），完成首宗交易後3日內還會透過電郵獲發$20正價貨品回購碼。VIP會員單筆消費淨額達$1,000且完成訂單14天內未有退款，更可享雙倍積分（上限5,000分）及獲贈VIP專屬禮物一份。</p><p>註：上述折扣券及優惠碼每張訂單限用一個，不可疊加使用；優惠不適用於電子禮品卡、特選商品及商家直送產品，詳情以官網條款為準。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:56:46.129218+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1992,"images":20,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:32:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T11:51:07.187443+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:50:18.005832+00:00","content_hash":"ecf73321d53e295b568681db13021b6ec77672730fb28fe0020e7175ec37df6b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}